{"id":"n77676-1-7","stage":5,"title":"중성 · 中性","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n77676-1-7-1","ko":"내 친구는 중성의 목소리를 지니고 있어.","zh":"我的朋友拥有中性嗓音。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","explanation":"내：“나의(我的)”的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84426","senseId":"1","lemma":"내","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3"}},{"text":"친구는","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구는","audio":"/audio/3cc026d51b6dcef53c27.mp3"}},{"text":"중성의","meaning":"中性","explanation":"중성：中性；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"중성","audio":"/audio/bd6724a72eb18f268451.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77676","senseId":"1","lemma":"중성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"중성의","audio":"/audio/44dbc76e2c327f9855ae.mp3"}},{"text":"목소리를","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리를","audio":"/audio/9171d6def1068a9fe3f3.mp3"}},{"text":"지니고","meaning":"具有","explanation":"지니다：具有；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지니다","audio":"/audio/5be9a79d17befa9d50fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27766","senseId":"3","lemma":"지니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지니고","audio":"/audio/60772523f1117d15f5c1.mp3"}},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어","audio":"/audio/675a95c70a831521b983.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"b3378685b76ee79f","term":"내","zh":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3","entryId":"84426","definition":"“나의(我的)”的缩略。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"bd6724a72eb18f26","term":"중성","zh":"中性","audio":"/audio/bd6724a72eb18f268451.mp3","entryId":"77676","definition":"处于两种相对性质之间的性质。","pronunciation":["중성"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","term":"목소리","zh":"嗓音，声音","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3","entryId":"69464","definition":"从人喉咙里发出的声音。","pronunciation":["목쏘리"]},{"id":"5be9a79d17befa9d","term":"지니다","zh":"具有","audio":"/audio/5be9a79d17befa9d50fd.mp3","entryId":"27766","definition":"人具有品性或习惯等。","pronunciation":["지니다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/6bd56412aa0b6f80b08a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n77676-1-7-2","ko":"목소리만 들어서는 여자인지 남자인지 구분이 잘 안 되겠네.","zh":"仅凭声音很难分辨他是男是女呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"목소리만","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리만","audio":"/audio/72022c58ad48e1f4051a.mp3"}},{"text":"들어서는","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"1","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어서는","audio":"/audio/e365c70c9a974eeb2f99.mp3"}},{"text":"여자인지","meaning":"女子，女人","explanation":"여자：女子，女人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자인지","audio":"/audio/2569f7f69f3bed00251f.mp3"}},{"text":"남자인지","meaning":"男子，男人","explanation":"남자：男子，男人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"남자","audio":"/audio/c6a3b6d97217b4d81661.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60865","senseId":"1","lemma":"남자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남자인지","audio":"/audio/72eae993099243bdd6ca.mp3"}},{"text":"구분이","meaning":"区分，划分，区别","explanation":"구분：区分，划分，区别；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"구분","audio":"/audio/d8ba487317ac4e370c54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24492","senseId":"1","lemma":"구분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구분이","audio":"/audio/a0dc3d436a57c84fa14a.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠네.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠네","audio":"/audio/96c4fb121d1d897163d7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","t